      "message": "Using a fake ID managed by the Device would work. It would map the real ID when we want to destroy. I\u0027m totally fine doing that.\n\nHowever, could we consider that using a `FutureHandle` wrapper here basically achieve the same thing? By definition, `FutureHandle` object acts as a fake ID. And its wrapped value is the real ID.",
