      "message": "\u003e Could we not just allocate the FutureHandle (or shared_ptr) in the creation lambda and assert that it\u0027s non-null? Would that work for assertions?\n\nIgnore this suggestion; this wouldn\u0027t work as the `FutureHandle` must be allocated before an explicit `Destroy()` call captures it.",
